---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Books by Todd Kashdan">
  <div class="wrap page-hero">
    <p class="kicker">Five books &middot; millions of readers</p>
    <h1>Books that turn research into something you can <em>use</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Todd's work in psychology and well-being has reached millions of readers through five acclaimed books, translated into 15+ languages worldwide.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="news" style="align-items:flex-start;">
      <div>
        <p class="news-eyebrow">New &middot; 2027 &middot; Ten Street Press</p>
        <h2 style="max-width:26ch;">On Purpose: The Science of Building a Meaningful Life</h2>
        <p>[COPY NEEDED &mdash; real jacket description from Todd before this ships]</p>
        <div class="news-cta" style="margin-top:18px;">
          <a class="btn solid" href="#">Pre-order (link coming)</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="placeholder-cover">ON PURPOSE<br />cover art coming</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>The backlist</h2></div>

    <div class="book">
      <img src={base + "images/img_020.png"} alt="The Art of Insubordination book cover" />
      <div>
        <h3>The Art of Insubordination</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">How to Dissent and Defy Effectively</p>
        <p>Based on cutting-edge research, this is the essential guidebook for anyone seeking to be heard, make change, and rebel against an unhealthy, stagnant status quo. It's filled with fresh, engaging stories about dissenters in the trenches, and science that will make you see the world through a new lens.</p>
        <a class="book-buy" href="#">Learn more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="book">
      <img src={base + "images/img_021.jpeg"} alt="The Upside of Your Dark Side book cover" />
      <div>
        <h3>The Upside of Your Dark Side</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">Why Being Your Whole Self, Not Just Your "Good" Self, Drives Success and Fulfillment</p>
        <p>With Robert Biswas-Diener. Happiness experts have long told us to tune out negative emotions and focus on mindfulness, positivity, and optimism. Todd and Robert disagree: anger makes us creative, selfishness makes us brave, and guilt is a powerful motivator. The real key to success is emotional agility, using your entire psychological toolkit.</p>
        <a class="book-buy" href="#">Learn more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="book">
      <img src={base + "images/img_022.png"} alt="Curious? book cover" />
      <div>
        <h3>Curious?</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">Discover the Missing Ingredient to a Fulfilling Life</p>
        <p>The greatest opportunities for joy, purpose, and personal growth don't happen when we're searching for happiness directly. They happen when we're mindful, when we explore what's novel, when we're open to new experience and relish the unknown. A blueprint for becoming a curious explorer, comfortable with risk in an unpredictable world.</p>
        <a class="book-buy" href="#">Learn more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="book">
      <img src={base + "images/img_023.png"} alt="Designing Positive Psychology book cover" />
      <div>
        <h3>Designing Positive Psychology</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">Taking Stock and Moving Forward</p>
        <p>An edited volume evaluating the first decade of positive psychology from the perspective of nearly every leading researcher in the field, addressing gaps, biases, and methodological limitations, and exploring the field's most exciting open questions.</p>
        <a class="book-buy" href="#">Learn more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="book">
      <img src={base + "images/img_024.png"} alt="Mindfulness, Acceptance, and Positive Psychology book cover" />
      <div>
        <h3>Mindfulness, Acceptance, and Positive Psychology</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">The Seven Foundations of Well-Being</p>
        <p>11 chapters on topics ranging from love and perspective taking to positive interventions, written by leading scientists and practitioners across positive psychology and Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT).</p>
        <a class="book-buy" href="#">Learn more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="news">
      <div>
        <p class="news-eyebrow">Provoked &middot; Free &amp; Premium</p>
        <h2>Cultivate a curious mind between books.</h2>
        <p>Todd's Substack newsletter takes an unusual look at commonly accepted practices and ideas, read by over 5 million people.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="news-cta">
        <a class="btn solid" href={base + "provoked/"}>Read Provoked</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
